{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53208","headline":"诗偈 三十三 · 庞藴","name":"诗偈 三十三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"世人重珍宝，我则不如然。\n名闻即知足，富贵心不缘。\n唯乐箪瓢饮，无求澡镜铨。\n饥食西山稻，渴饮本源泉。\n寒披无相服，热来松下眠。\n知身无究竟，任运了残年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庞藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53208.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53208","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}